SeafoamIslands_1F_Text_GoldMeet::
    .string "GOLD: Hey! You are the kid from\n"
    .string "HEMATOWN, right? I am GOLD.\p"
    .string "That grumpy one is SILVER.$"

SeafoamIslands_1F_Text_SilverMeet::
    .string "SILVER: …Tch. I can introduce\n"
    .string "myself, you know.\p"
    .string "I heard what you did to KRONOS.\n"
    .string "Not bad. For a beginner.$"

SeafoamIslands_1F_Text_GoldPlan::
    .string "GOLD: This volcano is ONYBRIS base\n"
    .string "number four. The boss went down\p"
    .string "with the stone. We follow him\n"
    .string "all the way to the bottom.\p"
    .string "BRICE and FLORA fell to him.\n"
    .string "We will not.$"

SeafoamIslands_1F_Text_SilverPlan::
    .string "SILVER: Stay behind us, {PLAYER}.\n"
    .string "We take the lower floors first.\p"
    .string "Mop up the grunts we leave.\n"
    .string "And do not die on me.$"
